{"seq":2,"slug":"production-loops","title":"Production Loops","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/production-loops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"usage-telemetry","title":"使用遥测的采集","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/production-loops/usage-telemetry","wordCount":2419,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"drift-and-rot-detection","title":"漂移与腐化检测","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/production-loops/drift-and-rot-detection","wordCount":2525,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"feedback-to-improvement","title":"从反馈到改进提案","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/production-loops/feedback-to-improvement","wordCount":2327,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<p>一个 agent 体系装好之后真正的考验才开始：它每天都在被使用，也每天都在悄悄偏离你当初的设计。本章讲运行期的三件事——采集最小可用的使用遥测、定期检测配置与文档的漂移腐化、再把这些信号加工成具体的改进提案。三步连起来，你的个人 harness 就不再靠记忆和直觉维护，而是有了一条持续自我改善的闭环。</p>\n"}